        description: Some("Spar: plates 8 m by 32 m over girders every 8 m. The bolt line where a spar meets a neighbor is the shader's, from the form. One tile is 64 m of hull and must repeat: integer frequencies, and noise with period == frequency. Output color is albedo; the layer named lights is the lit share of each texel. See em_render::hull_material."),
